    "description": "Functional Programming, ``FP`` for short, is a programming paradigm where programs are built by combining pure functions, avoiding shared state, and minimizing side effects. Instead of focusing on 'how to do things' step by step, ``FP`` focuses on 'what to compute' by composing functions.\n\nPHP supports anonymous functions, closures, iterators and higher-order functions, needed for Functional programming.",
